"""Pull 0DTE option bid/ask quotes (1-sec bars) for one (symbol, date) and save
to MySQL t_opra_quotes.

Mirrors the approach in pull_data_from_thetadata.ipynb, adapted for equity/ETF
options with percentage-of-spot strike filtering.

Data access: ThetaData v3 (`thetadata` pip library via thetadata_helpers, gRPC
direct to Theta servers -- no local ThetaTerminal). Auth: THETADATA_API_KEY env
var or D:/PycharmProjects/utils/thetadata_creds.json. Migrated from the
deprecated v2 ThetaTerminal HTTP API (127.0.0.1:25510) on 2026-09-02.

Usage:
    python pull_options_single.py --symbol NVDA --date 2026-04-24
    python pull_options_single.py --symbol NVDA --date 2026-04-24 --dry-run
    python pull_options_single.py --symbol NVDA --date 2026-04-24 --force
"""
